{"id":"inicial","lemma":"inicial","pos":"adj","rank":3375,"glosses":["initial"],"ipa":"/iniˈθjal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"iniciales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-inicial.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuáles son sus iniciales?","en":"What are your initials?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/119092","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which","l":"cuál"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Sólo leí las páginas iniciales.","en":"I only read the first few pages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741235","words":[null,{"g":"to read","l":"leer"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"page","l":"página"},null]},{"text":"La pareja grabó sus iniciales en el roble.","en":"The couple carved their initials into the oak tree.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599208","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"couple, pair"},{"g":"to record","l":"grabar"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"oak"}]},{"text":"Los síntomas iniciales de la enfermedad son fiebre y dolor de garganta.","en":"The initial symptoms of the disease are fever and sore throat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516106","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"symptom","l":"síntoma"},null,null,null,{"g":"illness, disease"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"fever"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"pain"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"throat"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom talló sus iniciales en un gran roble frente al colegio.","en":"Tom carved his initials on the large oak tree in front of the school.","words":[null,null,{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"oak"},{"g":"forehead, brow"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"school"}]}]}